WEBVTT

00:03:58.316 --> 00:04:00.956
that some of the leaders there
will be frankly daunted,

00:04:00.996 --> 00:04:03.476
maybe aghast, even horrified

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:06.756
at the scale and speed
and breadth and depth

00:04:06.796 --> 00:04:09.036
of the transformation
that you're talking about.

00:04:09.076 --> 00:04:11.396
What is your message
to your business peers?

00:04:12.316 --> 00:04:14.636
JD: My message to them is simple.

00:04:15.236 --> 00:04:19.716
It's that climate change
has been underhyped,

00:04:19.716 --> 00:04:20.956
underhyped.

00:04:20.996 --> 00:04:23.516
We are underestimating

00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:26.996
the economic opportunity

00:04:26.996 --> 00:04:29.876
and the risk in this transition.